Package: yca
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: bind9-dnsutils
Description: Two-tier ECDSA certificate authority CLI with an ACME frontend
 yca is a command-line certificate authority tool (ECDSA, two-tier
 root/intermediate hierarchy) with yca-acme, an ACME frontend for
 automated certificate issuance.
 .
 bind9-dnsutils (nsupdate) is needed only if the ACME client used against
 repository_host validates via DNS-01 through dynamic DNS (e.g. acme.sh's
 dns_nsupdate hook).
